OL,3,GNEWSAFire crews spend night at grass
OL,4,Afire near Moray campsite
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters have spent the night at
OL,7,Fthe scene of a grass fire near the
OL,8,FMoray village of Hopeman.
OL,10,FSix appliances and a wildfire unit were
OL,11,Fsent to the scene at around 16:30 on
OL,12,FTuesday.
OL,14,FFour appliances remained there at first
OL,15,Flight.
OL,17,FFootage shared by Fubar News showed
OL,18,Fflames and dense smoke next to a
OL,19,Fcampsite, containing campervans and
OL,20,Fcaravans.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
